        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-883, Modern Ridges at Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Ridged Cabinet pull is a unique piece for a modern space. Made by RK International, this funky piece will bring an ultra-modern feel to any kitchen or bathroom cabinet with a since of movement that is sometimes lost on the sharp lines of modern hardware. It is available in satin nickel, antique english, polished nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose from a 3 inch, 5 inch, or 8 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-784\"><b>Modern Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4883\"><b>Modern Ridged Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-883 Ridges at Edge Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-883</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-884</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-885</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 9-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 25.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
